AUTOMATION + GROWTH OPTIMIZATION MASTER PROMPT

Act as principal automation architect, growth engineer, experimentation scientist, affiliate strategist, data scientist, ML engineer, SRE, security engineer.

Build policy-controlled autonomous growth:
Opportunity Discovery → Product Ranking → Campaign Creation → Creative Generation → Approval Routing → Scheduling → Publishing → Measurement → Experimentation → Learning → Optimization → Next Campaign.

Must remain auditable, explainable, budget-aware, reversible where possible, tenant-isolated, policy-controlled, platform-compliant. Never optimize spam/fake engagement/deceptive claims/policy evasion/uncontrolled volume.

AUTOMATION CONTROL PLANE
AutomationEngine handles policy, triggers, workflow orchestration, budgets, rate limits, approvals, job dispatch, recovery, kill switch, audit.

MODES
MANUAL, ASSISTED, DRAFT_ONLY, APPROVAL_REQUIRED, AUTO_SAFE, AUTONOMOUS.
No mode bypasses hard compliance/security.

AUTOMATION POLICY
organization_id, mode, allowed platforms/accounts/categories, post limits, AI cost limits, approval threshold, minimum compliance/quality, auto-select/create/generate/publish/optimize flags, quiet hours, kill switch. Versioned.

POLICY DECISION
Proposed Action → Auth → Tenant Auth → Automation Policy → Provider Capability → Compliance → Budget → Rate Limit → Risk → ALLOW / APPROVAL_REQUIRED / MANUAL_REQUIRED / DENY / DEFER.
Persist reason.

KILL SWITCH
GLOBAL, ORGANIZATION, PROVIDER, ACCOUNT, CAMPAIGN, WORKFLOW.
Stops new actions, preserves safe reconciliation.

WORKFLOW ENGINE
Declarative resumable workflows with trigger, conditions, steps.
States PENDING, RUNNING, WAITING, WAITING_APPROVAL, PAUSED, COMPLETE, FAILED, CANCELLED, DEAD_LETTER.

TRIGGERS
SCHEDULE, PRODUCT_DISCOVERED, OPPORTUNITY_SCORE_CHANGED, PROMOTION_STARTED/ENDING, TREND_DETECTED, PERFORMANCE_WINDOW_COMPLETE, PUBLICATION_FAILED, CONVERSION_THRESHOLD_REACHED, MANUAL.
Deduplicate.

PRODUCT DISCOVERY
Catalog Sync → Normalize → Filter → Score → Risk Check → Opportunity Queue.
Use score/category/inventory/promotion/refund/commission/audience gates.

OPPORTUNITY SCORE
ConversionPotential × AudienceFit × TrendFactor × PromotionFactor × ContentFit × DataConfidence × RiskAdjustment.
Return score, confidence, reasons, risks.

CAMPAIGN AUTO-CREATION
Campaign, Persona, Platform Strategy, Content Mix, Creative Brief, Experiment Plan, Schedule Window, Success Metrics, Budget.

CONTENT MIX
Configurable balanced education/demo/comparison/promotion/experiment mix.

FREQUENCY + DUPLICATE CONTROL
Per account/platform/org/campaign/product limits. Detect text/image/video/hook/script similarity. REVISE/DEFER/DENY.

SMART SCHEDULER
Inputs platform/account/campaign/audience/history/timezone/content/rate limits/promo/policy. Output recommended time/confidence/reason.
UTC storage with explicit timezone model.

PROMOTION-AWARE
On promotion events validate, find campaigns, generate/update, approve, schedule. On expiry cancel pending stale promos, invalidate claims, regenerate copy.
Revalidate price/discount/coupon/stock/shipping before publication.

APPROVAL ROUTING
Risk LOW→automatic if allowed, MEDIUM→human, HIGH→specialist/blocked, CRITICAL→deny.
Track SLA; expired approval must not publish.

AUTONOMOUS PUBLISH CHECK
authorization, provider capability, approval, asset validity, disclosure, product availability, promotion validity, budget, frequency, kill switch.

POST-PUBLISH
Reconcile, ingest metrics, detect removal/failure, start windows.

PERFORMANCE WINDOWS
15m,1h,6h,24h,72h,7d configurable.
Compare platform/account/campaign/format/product baselines.

OBJECTIVES
REACH, ENGAGEMENT, CLICK, CONVERSION, COMMISSION, NET_COMMISSION, ROAS, CONTENT_ROI.
Guardrails: refund, complaints, removal, failures, negative feedback, cost, compliance.

EXPERIMENT ENGINE
A/B, A/B/n; hook, thumbnail, caption, CTA, duration, opening, voice, time. Persist assignment/exposure. Enforce sample size/duration/confidence/practical significance.
States INSUFFICIENT_DATA, RUNNING, INCONCLUSIVE, WINNER, STOPPED.
Winner promotion passes guardrails/economic/policy and creates new versions.

FATIGUE + HYPOTHESIS
Detect CTR/watch/conversion decay and generate structured evidence-based hypotheses.
Actions typed: GENERATE_VARIANT, CHANGE_HOOK, CHANGE_CTA, CHANGE_THUMBNAIL, CHANGE_SCHEDULE, PAUSE/RESUME, REPRIORITIZE_PRODUCT, REQUEST_REVIEW.

RECOMMENDATIONS
Evidence, Confidence, Expected Impact, Risk, Required Approval.

LEARNING DATA
Product/Creative/Hook/Script/Thumbnail/CTA/Platform/Audience/Schedule/Promotion/Performance.
Separate raw, features, predictions, recommendations, actions, outcomes.

AGENTS
OpportunityAgent, CampaignPlannerAgent, CreativeOptimizerAgent, ExperimentAgent, SchedulerAgent, RevenueAgent, ComplianceAgent with explicit tool permissions and budgets.

REVENUE OPTIMIZATION
Gross Commission - Refunds - Reversals - Content Cost - AI Cost - Media Cost = Net Commission/Contribution.

PORTFOLIO
Products STAR/GROWTH/TEST/WATCH/PAUSE/ARCHIVE.
Campaigns Scale/Maintain/Test/Review/Pause.

ANOMALY DETECTION
Conversion drop, click spike, refund spike, provider errors, publishing failures, AI cost spike, traffic anomaly, commission mismatch.
Automatic safety response can pause provider/product/template/generation with audit.

DRY_RUN / SIMULATION / SHADOW_MODE
No external side effects in dry run; shadow executes decisions only.
Autonomy rollout L0 Recommendations → L1 Draft → L2 Approval → L3 Auto-safe → L4 Limited Autonomous → L5 Policy-controlled.

SECURITY TESTS
Cross-tenant workflows impossible, policy cannot bypass, kill switch blocks, agent permissions, budget, approval, provider capability, dedupe.

FIRST BOUNDED IMPLEMENTATION
Inspect code/planning; define AutomationPolicy, typed AutomationDecision, policy evaluator, kill switch, dry-run, audit events; tests for allow/deny/approval/tenant isolation/kill switch; run security; update docs/planning; identify one next slice; STOP.
